We also need candidate_created destination_availability_alpha (goal) and candidate_created shift_candidate_beta (goal). So we need to create those candidates.

We also need candidate_created shift_candidate_alpha? Not in goal, but we need it for processing shift_candidate_alpha (to prepare etc). Initially we don't have candidate_created for shift_candidate_alpha. So we need to create it as well.

