Thus we need to create four candidates: shift_candidate_alpha, shift_candidate_beta, origin_availability_alpha, destination_availability_alpha.

But note: origin_availability_alpha and destination_availability_alpha are already defined as objects of type origin_candidate_availability and destination_candidate_availability. They exist but not yet created (candidate_created false). So we need to run create_candidate on them.

