C. Assemble transport leg:
   c1. assemble_transport_leg origin_availability_alpha destination_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha destination_node_alpha transport_leg_alpha
   (Preconditions: origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, node linked, nodes ready, availabilities confirmed, transport_leg_available). All should be true after locks.

D. Authorize transport leg loading:
   Need origin_availability_locked (true), candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha.
   So we need to attach task profile to origin_availability_alpha again.
   c2. attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
   c3. authorize_transport_leg_loading transport_leg_alpha origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
   c4. detach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (optional after auth)

E. Prepare shift_candidate_alpha for loading:
   Need candidate_prepared, vehicle allocated, loading container linked, etc.

   Steps:
   e1. create_candidate shift_candidate_alpha
   e2. allocate_vehicle_unit shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma (remaining)
   e3. attach_task_profile shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
