   e11. establish_clearance_nominal shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha
   e12. finalize_candidate_direct shift_candidate_alpha (requires candidate_clearance_established, not route_sequence_context_set, not candidate_finalized)
   (Note: finalize_candidate_direct sets dispatch_ready and candidate_finalized.)

But we need to ensure we have operator available for step e5. At this point, after we released operator from origin and destination locks, operator_available should be true. We allocated operator to shift_candidate_alpha, we may need to release after we are done? Goal requires operator_available at end, so we must release after we finish using it for shift_candidate_alpha. However after finalize_candidate_direct we may not need operator anymore; we can release.

