But also verify_loading_profile_nominal requires candidate_operator_linked (so we need operator linked). So we need to keep operator linked until after verify_loading_profile_nominal (which doesn't consume operator). Then we can release.

Thus after e10 we can release operator.

Now we also need to ensure we have not used up loading_container_alpha elsewhere; we used it for shift_candidate_alpha. That's fine.

Now we also need to ensure we have not used up compliance_certificate_alpha elsewhere; we only use for shift_candidate_alpha.

Now we also need to ensure we have not used up skill_certificate_alpha elsewhere; we only use for shift_candidate_alpha.

