Goal also requires candidate_created destination_availability_alpha and candidate_created shift_candidate_beta (we have those). Also requires vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha and candidate_vehicle_linked origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha (we have from step a2). Also requires operator_available driver_operator_alpha (we will release after using for shift_candidate_alpha). So final state should satisfy.

